     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:tahoma,sans-serif;font-size:small\">Hi all,<br><br>Tomorrow (Friday, 5/15) at 10am in Wickson 2124 Grace Charles will give a talk on structural equation modeling (SEM) in R. If you can&#39;t make it in person, check it out live online, <a href=\"https://plus.google.com/events/clu0tuh1d7vtj7inrucnf57j52s\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://plus.google.com/events/clu0tuh1d7vtj7inrucnf57j52s&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792468216122000&amp;usg=AOvVaw36pn7gfm0g7WalwoEP0423\">here</a>. From Grace:<br><br>I&#39;ll give a presentation on structural equation models in R. Structural equation models are a way to estimate both direct and indirect connections among a set of variables. They&#39;re also visual, making them great way to link complex concepts and your data. I&#39;ll show some examples using the Lavaan package.<br><br>We will have the usual work session after the talk until 12. See you there,<br><br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:tahoma,sans-serif;font-size:small\">Michael<br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:tahoma,sans-serif;font-size:small\"><br clear=\"all\"></div><br clear=\"all\"><div><div class=\"gmail_signature\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><p style=\"line-height:1.15;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.15;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><font style=\"line-height:normal\" face=\"arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><br></font></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.15;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><font style=\"line-height:normal\" face=\"arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Michael Levy</font></p><div><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">PhD Candidate</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">Department of Environmental Science and Policy</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">University of California, Davis</span><br></div><div><a href style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\" data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">mal...@ucdavis.edu</a><br></div><div><font color=\"#0000ee\" face=\"arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><u><a href=\"http://www.michaellevy.name/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.michaellevy.name/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792468216122000&amp;usg=AOvVaw221a8XG0ZONcnibU4kZ150\">www.michaellevy.name</a></u></font></div><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt\"><span><span style=\"font-size:15px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:transparent;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap\"></span></span></p></div></div></div></div></div>\r\n</div>\r\n"
